{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はブログ書くのが遅くなっちゃって\n時間がないので、\n選抜発表のブログはまた明日書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせちゃってすみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉がまとまらなくて、\nきっと出来上がったブログもまとまってないと思うけど、それでもあんまり\nしっくりこなかったから書けなかった。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと私なりの言葉で\n書きたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、もう少し待っていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからのあたたかいコメント\n読ませてもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、目がすごくかわく。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでだろう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙腺に涙たまってないのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最近そんなに泣いてない気がする。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、涙腺に涙たまってるはず。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのになんでこんなに目が乾くんだろう。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そもそも、泣いてないと涙腺に涙溜まるものなのかな？\nここからここまで！！！っていう涙残量メーター的なのがあって\n使うとたまってくシステムなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に見た何かのアニメに\n涙を集めたカプセルみたいなのが\n出てきたの思い出した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その涙カプセルの涙の量しか\n涙を流せないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間はそんなふうになってないと思うけど\nもしそうだったら\n私はとっくに涙カプセルの中\nカラッカラッになってると思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん、普通の人の\n倍の倍の倍の倍の倍の倍の倍くらいの\n涙カプセル必要だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、もっと必要かも。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、こんな感じに\nたぶんありえない\nもしもの話しを\n頭の中で考えてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうありそうでなさそうな話しを\nもしもの仮定で蘭世とするの好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世のもしもの話し\n結構面白いんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世節全開ってかんじ！\nご飯いこうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/07/5669698/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月6日  発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TopYellさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛とアンダーライブ\n東北ツアーのお話しを\nさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛と二人でお仕事は初めてだったかな？\nたくさんふざけて楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月15日   発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人なグラビアをとって頂きました！\nお気に入りオフショットもあるから\nまた発売されたらのせます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月23日   発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳前、最後のUTBさんの撮影です！\n2回目のソログラビアでした！\n衣装が普段着ない大人な衣装で\nついに、私も\n○○○一枚で撮影しました(｡・・｡)！\nおたのしみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月23日    発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツ企画と\nひなコレ(ひなコレクションという連載企画)\nに、出させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperさんの撮影は\n普段できないメイクやファッションできるので\n毎回ワクワクします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋号の撮影もたのしみです！"}],"source":"archive"}